{"id":"29cdfd3ede855148","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Linear Order Without Endpoints","display":"df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints — ZFC Order12 Linear Order Without Endpoints","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints — ZFC Order12 Linear Order Without Endpoints","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints — ZFC Order12 Linear Order Without Endpoints"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,&lt;\\in V\">\\(X,&lt;\\in V\\)</span> (carrier and strict order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LinearOrderWithoutEndpoints}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LinearOrderWithoutEndpoints}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}without\\text{-}endpoints} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LinearOrderWithoutEndpoints}_S(X,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n&lt;\\;\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\neg(x&lt;x)\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(x&lt;y\\land y&lt;z\\to x&lt;z)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to x&lt;y\\lor y&lt;x)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists y,z\\in X\\;(y&lt;x\\land x&lt;z)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}without\\text{-}endpoints} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LinearOrderWithoutEndpoints}_S(X,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n&lt;\\;\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\neg(x&lt;x)\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(x&lt;y\\land y&lt;z\\to x&lt;z)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to x&lt;y\\lor y&lt;x)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists y,z\\in X\\;(y&lt;x\\land x&lt;z)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary endpoint-free linear order definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,<\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LinearOrderWithoutEndpoints}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}without\\text{-}endpoints} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LinearOrderWithoutEndpoints}_S(X,<)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n<\\;\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\neg(x<x)\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(x<y\\land y<z\\to x<z)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to x<y\\lor y<x)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists y,z\\in X\\;(y<x\\land x<z)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1061,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2914","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints.md|58-df-zfc-order12-linear-order-without-endpoints]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}